# config/model-denylist - models this home must never run (docs/configuration.md
# "Forbidden models" owns the contract). Copy this into a local, gitignored
# config/model-denylist and edit. One item per non-empty line; text from "#" to
# end of line is a comment.
#
# Each item is a denied FRAGMENT, matched case-insensitively against any part of
# the requested model. One vendor model reaches Firstmate under several
# spellings, so a fragment covers them all: "fable" below denies "fable",
# "claude-fable-5", and "anthropic/claude-fable-5" alike.
#
# List vendor ALIASES too. An alias resolves to a concrete model inside the
# harness, and that mapping changes without notice, so Firstmate cannot resolve
# one without asking the vendor and spending on the answer. An alias is denied
# only when you list it.
#
# By default a profile or spawn that names NO model is refused as well, because
# the harness would then take its own account-level default, which the vendor
# controls and can change to the very model you forbade. Uncomment the directive
# at the bottom to accept harness defaults again.

# The model whose cost this home has ruled out, under every spelling.
fable

# Aliases that resolve to a model rather than naming one.
best
latest

# Accept harness defaults again, recorded here rather than left implicit.
#allow-unspecified-model
